            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='78250' id='14' type-v2='text' w='92430' x='3782' y='10667'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontsize='12'>Metrics</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#d61f26' fontsize='12' italic='true'># Survey Attendance Rate</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='12'>Number of exit survey respondents / Number of terminations effective</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#d61f26' fontsize='12' italic='true'># Avg. Manager Rating for Performance Meetings </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='12'>This rating is calculated based on participants&apos; answers of following question in the survey: </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='12' italic='true'>&quot;How frequently did your manager discuss your job performance with you?&quot;</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='12'>Each answer is converted into numerical values from 1 to 5 where 1 being the worst value, 5 being the best value:</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='12'>5 - Every two weeks or more </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='12'>4 - Monthly</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='12'>3 - Quarterly</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='12'>2 - Once or twice a year</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='12'>1 - Never</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='12'>Then, average is taken per each manager. </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#d61f26' fontsize='12' italic='true'># Avg. Manager Rating for Support &amp; Feedback</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='12'>This rating is calculated based on participants&apos; answers of following question in the survey: </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='12' italic='true'>&quot;My manager provided me with the support and feedback I needed to successfully complete my work&quot;</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='12'>Each answer is converted into numerical values from 1 to 5 where 1 being the worst value, 5 being the best value:</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='12'>5 - Fully Agree </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='12'>4 -  Agree </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='12'>3 -  Neutral</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='12'>2 - Disagree </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='12'>1 - Fully Disagree </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='12'>Then, average is taken per each manager. </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
